# NOTICE — third-party components in xkvm

xkvm embeds (via `//go:embed all:extras`) third-party binaries and frameworks under
`internal/extras/extras/`. Verify license obligations before any public release.

## Hook frameworks (auto-injected by the injector)

### ElleKit — BSD 3-Clause
- **Binary:** `internal/extras/extras/ElleKit.framework/ElleKit` — fat **arm64 + arm64e**,
  version **1.1.3**
- **Upstream:** https://github.com/evelyneee/ElleKit (BSD 3-Clause; copyright ElleKit Team)
- **Purpose:** the `--ellekit` injection runtime (see `feather-ellekit-spec.md`, decisions D1/D7/D8)
- **Rebuild recipe:** `docs/ellekit-build.md` (verified build + assembly steps)
- **Note:** the embedded `CydiaSubstrate.framework` in this tree is **ElleKit 1.1.3 renamed**
  (its codesign Identifier is `libellekit.dylib`) — it serves the default substrate mode.

### CydiaSubstrate.framework — permissive (ElleKit-backed)
- ElleKit 1.1.3 renamed to the substrate install name, as cyan ships it. See ElleKit entry above.

### Orion.framework, Cephei.framework, CepheiUI.framework, CepheiPrefs.framework
- Carried over from cyan's `extras/` directory (permissive; the Cephei family is
  GPL-family licensed — verify before public release).

